<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px 8px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 18px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; COLOR: rgb(73,4,144); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">六、“工程科学”冬令营优秀营员优惠政策</STRONG></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px 8px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">本着公开、公平、公正的原则，根据营员在冬令营期间的综合表现，经专家组评审考察，向表现出色的营员颁发《天津大学工程科学冬令营证书》：</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px 8px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">（1）卓越证书：考生通过高考进入天津大学工科试验班（精仪与光电信息类）后，可免试进入精仪学院工程科学实验班。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px 8px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">（2）优秀证书：考生通过高考进入天津大学工科试验班（精仪与光电信息类）后，可获得精仪学院工程科学实验班选拔资格。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px 8px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 18px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; COLOR: rgb(73,4,144); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">七、收费标准</STRONG></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px 8px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">冬令营收费2500元/人。冬令营期间统一安排住宿事宜，食宿、交通费自理。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px 8px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 18px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; COLOR: rgb(73,4,144); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">八、联系方式</STRONG></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px 8px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">地址：天津市南开区卫津路92号天津大学精仪学院本科生事务中心（第17教学楼311室）</P>
